<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Project Invitation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #6366f1;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #6366f1;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Project Invitation</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <h2>Hello!</h2>

        <p><strong>{{invitedByUsername}}</strong> has invited you to join the project:</p>

        <h3>{{projectName}}</h3>

        <p>{{message}}</p>

        <p>To accept this invitation, please log in to your HereToTranslate account and check your project invitations.</p>

        {{#if expiresIn}}
        <p><strong>Note:</strong> This invitation will expire in {{expiresIn}} day(s).</p>
        {{/if}}

        <p>If you have any questions, please contact the project owner or our support team.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>This invitation was sent from HereToTranslate.</p>
        <p>If you didn't expect this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
